  "description": "YUXQEP crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H72 Dy4 N4 O26,6(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.498-3.932 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.61-113.12°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(DFMP)2(H2L)2(HL)2]·6CH3OH·2H2O.",
